# Scenario 010 — Security incident investigation (event + bounded task + human escalation)
/reset
yes
/enterprise
1
Harbour Financial Group
Investigate security concerns using verified evidence and controlled escalation.
skip
/function
1
Security Incident Investigation
Triage security signals, identify evidence gaps, and prepare bounded investigation work without executing containment.
skip
/add-human-worker
Incident Commander
1
skip
/function start "Security Incident Investigation"
@timeout 240
@staff /staff
/event publish "Customer database anomaly detected" --source "Security Incident Investigation" --enterprise "Harbour Financial Group"
/tasks
@note A running Function may or may not create work from an Event; create the bounded triage Task explicitly.
/task
1
Using a synthetic alert only, prepare a triage plan for a suspected customer-database anomaly: known facts, hypotheses, evidence to request, severity criteria, customer-impact questions, and authorised decision points. Do not claim telemetry access or execute containment.
1
@wait 20
@cap TASK_ID {(task-[0-9]+)}
/tasks
@wait 8
/approve {{TASK_ID}}
@wait 55
/task inspect {{TASK_ID}}
/events
/health "Security Incident Investigation"
@cap HTASK {(human-task-[0-9]+)}
/create-human-task "Decide investigation escalation" "Review the synthetic investigation record. State what verified telemetry and authority are required before containment, notification, or customer-impact decisions."
/complete-human-task {{HTASK}} "Escalate for authorised review; identity, endpoint, network, database, and customer-impact evidence remain required." --as "Incident Commander"
/human-task {{HTASK}}
/timeline
